size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\">Join a high-performance culture that values intellectual curiosity, initiative, collaboration, and merit-based advancement.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 15.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: 15.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\">As a Commercial Due Diligence Director, you&rsquo;ll play a leadership role in </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\">Grant Thornton | Stax Transactions</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\">, partnering with corporate leaders and private equity investors to evaluate growth potential, downside risk, and value creation opportunities across transactions.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: 15.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\">You&rsquo;ll combine deep commercial diligence expertise, strong client leadership, and business development acumen&mdash;serving as a trusted advisor while helping grow the firm&rsquo;s Commercial Due Diligence capability.</span></p>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 15.0pt;\" align=\"center\"><