gin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: 15.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in business, Economics, Finance, Strategy, or a related field</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: 15.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\">Typically, 8&ndash;10+ years of experience in commercial due diligence, strategy consulting, transaction advisory, or private equity</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: 15.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\">Proven experience leading PE‑backed and corporate M&amp;A diligence engagements</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: 15.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\">Strong expertise in: </span></li>\n<ul type=\"circle\">\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: 15.0pt; mso-list: l1 level2 lfo2; tab-stops: list 1.0in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\">Market sizing and growth assessment</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" 