 line-height: 15.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: 15.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\">Preferred</span></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: 15.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\">Private equity or investment committee‑facing experience</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: 15.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\">Advanced degree (MBA or equivalent)</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: 15.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\">Experience supporting post‑close value creation or growth strategy</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: 15.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: 15.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\">Locations:</span></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: 15.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\">Chicago, Boston, and NYC. </span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: 15.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\">Consistent with the firm&rsquo;s hybrid work model, this position requires in-person attendance three days per week at a firm office or client site.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"none\">Compensation &amp; Benefits</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">This role offers competitive compensation, including a base salary range of $230,000&ndash;$300,000, plus a target annual bonus. Grant Thornton Stax follows a pay-for-performance compensation philosophy, base salary is commensurate with experience, and total cash compensation may vary based on individual and firm performance.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">We also offer a comprehensive benefits package, including medical, dental, and vision coverage for you and your family; expanded family planning benefits; a 401(k) plan with company contributions regardless of your own; open vacation policy; life and disability insurance; generous parental leave; pre-tax transit benefits; mobile phone stipend; wellness reimbursement; charitable gift matching; and more.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US